# Publish every curated run directory and every non-checkpoint artifact.
# The repository-level .gitignore explicitly exposes this 64D archive.
!**/
!**

# Never publish interpreter or test caches copied with an analysis folder.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# Keep iteration checkpoints local by default. Add one exact negated path for
# the numerically latest checkpoint whenever a completed run is curated.
**/model_*.pt
